    {
      "id": "claim_e19565fd477d487e8835ed1897a5a03c",
      "statement": "For determinations made on or after the order's effective date, the qualified-client determination uses either the Rule 205-3 assets-under-management or net-worth test in SEC Order IA-7104; the order specifies the net-worth treatment of a primary residence and permits jointly held spousal assets for a natural person.",
