    {
      "id": "claim_70fcc9ce7a574a629c9449b2a26dfc58",
      "statement": "Accredited-investor status is a separate determination from qualified-client status because Order IA-7104 adjusts only Rule 205-3 dollar tests and leaves Regulation D accredited-investor criteria and the qualified-purchaser definition unchanged.",
